 > Zuri Cliff is a private, adults-only oceanfront villa on the cliffs of Makunduchi, South Zanzibar, Tanzania. Not a resort, not a hotel — a private home at the edge of the Indian Ocean, personally managed and available for exclusive whole-villa rental.
 
-Zuri Cliff is a single-property luxury vacation rental. It is not a hotel chain, resort, or booking platform. The property has 2 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, sleeps 4 guests, and features a private infinity pool, a ~220 m² clifftop timber deck, and a Barazza lounge. The villa is adults-only (18+) and rented exclusively to one party at a time — it does not accommodate multiple simultaneous bookings. Built with local craftsmen using teak and island materials, and powered substantially by its own solar array (15.47 kWp) with battery storage.
